{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"img":"chara028_0","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"y":-530,"x":170,"scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara028_0","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"y":-530,"x":170,"scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]呼……感觉人生突然充满了希望……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]瞧瞧告诉{myName}哦，三天前……我……我成功接待了一位客人耶。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]在我和他说完欢迎光临以后，他向我点了两杯酿和一个深渊面包。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]说时迟那时快，我立刻跑到柜台把顾客的需求报上去。[r]等到餐出来以后，我又快速把餐带到客人桌上。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]当看见客人离开时满面春风的模样，我就知道我成功了。[r]我以侍者的身份完美完成了一次接待工作。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]嘿嘿……虽然有些得意忘形……但是成功的感觉真好……[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":0,"img":"chara028_0","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"y":-530,"x":170,"scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"yd_028_07","des":"格薇勒-成功的乐趣"}